# Phase 4 forensics — generated from a single base capture by the ImageMagick
# recipe recorded in docs/evidence/phase4-forensics/README.md, which is why the
# same OPPO EXIF block appears in all of them. Verified: 0 GPS tags in each.
!docs/evidence/phase4-forensics/authentic.jpg
!docs/evidence/phase4-forensics/edited_photoshop.jpg
!docs/evidence/phase4-forensics/spliced_final.jpg
!docs/evidence/phase4-forensics/spliced_ela_heatmap.png

# The same fixtures bundled as instrumented-test assets for ForensicInstrumentedTest.
!android/app/src/androidTest/assets/rl_authentic.jpg
!android/app/src/androidTest/assets/rl_photoshop.jpg
!android/app/src/androidTest/assets/rl_spliced.jpg

# MesoNet reference images (DariusAf/MesoNet, Apache-2.0) — the authors' own four
# published samples, and the only labelled images this project has. Required by
# DeepfakeClassifierInstrumentedTest, which asserts the model's convention is not
# inverted (ADR-0010); without them that test cannot run and an inverted model
# would read as a working one. Verified: 0 EXIF tags of any kind in each.
!android/app/src/androidTest/assets/df00204.jpg
!android/app/src/androidTest/assets/df01254.jpg
!android/app/src/androidTest/assets/real00240.jpg
!android/app/src/androidTest/assets/real00772.jpg

